  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-30T03:54:11.649Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When VRC crashes, it should have a menu saying \"Send crash report to improve vrc?\" Just having this will have a significant impact on problems. A majority of users do not \"send the logs\" when they have to go out of their way to open an folder and send an email, this is lost data that can be used to significantly improve vrchat and figure out what happened\n\nUsing this will significantly help reduce wasted time by sending useful data that can be combed and categorized into a more useful form\nFind out if a problem is hardware specific such as a potential problem with a headset, a problem with a computer component, drivers ect\n\nBut the purpose of this is to have people actually send in their bug reports rather than just compain about the game crashing on social media\nThe added bonus of having a crash report screen is that it can send older crash dumps  that haven't been reported and check to see if an issue has occurred before \n\nPros: \n-automatic \"send me your logs\" without emailing\n-more data that can be used for reviewing\n-crash dumps actually sent\n-logs with commentsbon submission (\"crashed while idle\" or \"crashed while joining world\")\n\nCons: \n-crash logs with comments saying \"fix it tupper\"\n-.txt documents tha you have to write a bot for to scan automatically\n-have to recieve this data\n-more work",
